<title>CANADA: Horsham Q3 rises on dilution gain.</title>
<headline>Horsham Q3 rises on dilution gain.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			    1995</p>
<p> Shr			US$0.49		  US$0.14</p>
<p> Net			 53,000		   14,100</p>
<p>	   9  MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			US$0.69		  US$0.40</p>
<p> Net			 73,800		   41,800</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 108,700		  108,000</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>Note: Full name is Horsham Corp. All figures are in U.S. dollars. Earnings include dilution gains. Excluding dilution gains, Horsham reported a loss of US$3.2 million or US$0.03 a share in the quarter. The company said its proposed merger with Trizec Corp Ltd should be completed in early November.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Toronto Bureau 416 941-8100</p>
